@title Summer Reading 2026 Wrap-Up
@subtitle Hollis Public Library, June to August 2026
@author Hollis Public Library

## Summer at a glance

kpi Registered | 1,248 | children and teens
kpi Finished | 683 | 54.7% of readers | good
kpi Books logged | 8,325 | 6.7 per reader
kpi Closing party | 310 | people on 2026-09-12

Thank you to every young reader who joined us this summer. More than half of those who signed up finished the program.

## Books logged by month

data books = month,books; Jun,2340; Jul,3115; Aug,2870
chart bar books x=month y=books focus="Jul" labels title="Books logged per month"

July was the busiest month, with 3,115 books logged. Across the three months readers logged 8,325 books.

## Readers by age group

data ages = age group,readers; Under 8,402; 8 to 12,561; 13 to 17,285
chart hbar ages x=age group y=readers labels title="Registered readers by age group"

The 8 to 12 group was the largest, with 561 of the 1,248 registered readers.
